  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Shifters.HintZone
  RealHint: Walk one intern to the striped mark at the edge and press B to become a 6.5 m plank. Switch to the others and walk across one at a time. Then switch back and press B to snap to the far side.
  VagueHint: The gap is exactly one intern long. Ish.
